{"strongs": "H5071", "word": "נְדָבָה", "translit": "ne.da.vah", "root": "נגל", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "voluntariness, freewill-offering", "definition": "נְדָבָה noun feminine voluntariness, freewill-offering ; — absolute ׳ נ Exod 35:29 + 14 t.; construct נִדְבַת Deut 16:10 plural נְדָבוֺת Amos 4:5 ; Ps 68:10 נְדָבֹת Ps 110:3 construct נִדְבוֺת Ps 119:108 ; 2Chr 31:14 suffix נִדְבֹתֶ֫יךָ Deut 12:7 + 4 t. suffixes; — 1. voluntariness אֹהֲבֵם נְדָבָה Hos 14:5 I ( ׳ י ) will love them freely ; עַמְּךָ נְדָבֹת בְּיוֺם חֵילֶ֑ךָ Ps 110:3 thy people will be (all) voluntariness in the day of thy host (be ready to volunteer, see Br MP 133 ); גֶּשֶׁם נדבות Ps 68:10 generous (copious) rain ; בנדבה Ps 54:8 voluntarily , and adverb. accusative נדבה Deut 23:24 (see Dr .). 2. freewill, voluntary, offering: \\ \\ a. including gifts used in erection and furnishing of tabernacle Exod 35:29 ; Exod 36:3 ( P ); for first temple 2Chr 31:14 , second Ezra 1:6 ; Ezra 8:28 . \\ \\ b. including עולה and שׁלמים Ezek 46:42 probably also Amos 4:5 , נדבות פִי Ps 119:108 . \\ \\ c. usually a זֶבַח for festival meals at Passover 2Chr 35:8 , Pentecost Deut 16:10 , Tabernacles Ezra 3:5 (besides the ritual offerings); distinguished from נֶדֶר votive offering Lev 7:16 ; Num 15:3 ; Num 29:39 ( P ), Lev 22:18 ; Lev 22:21 ; Lev 22:23 ; Lev 23:38 ( H ), Deut 12:6 ; Deut 12:17 . — (Verbs used are ׳ הביא נ Exod 35:29 ; Exod 36:3 ׳ הקריב נ Lev 22:18 ׳ עשׂה נ Num 15:3 ; Ezek 46:12 ׳ נתן נ Lev 23:38 ; Deut 16:10 .)", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4987')\">BDB4987</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5071')\">H5071</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4986')\">BDB4986</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4988')\">BDB4988</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נְדָבָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>voluntariness, freewill-offering</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,29)\">Exod 35:29</ref> + 14 t.; construct <bdbheb>נִדְבַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 16:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,10)\">Deut 16:10</ref> plural <bdbheb>נְדָבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 4:5\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,5)\">Amos 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,10)\">Ps 68:10</ref> <bdbheb>נְדָבֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 110:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"110\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"110\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,110,3)\">Ps 110:3</ref> construct <bdbheb>נִדְבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:108\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"108\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"108\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,108)\">Ps 119:108</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,14)\">2Chr 31:14</ref> suffix <bdbheb>נִדְבֹתֶ֫יךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 12:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,7)\">Deut 12:7</ref> + 4 t. suffixes; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b><highlight>voluntariness</highlight> <bdbheb>אֹהֲבֵם נְדָבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 14:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,5)\">Hos 14:5</ref> <highlight>I</highlight> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>) <highlight>will love them freely</highlight>; <bdbheb>עַמְּךָ נְדָבֹת בְּיוֺם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>חֵילֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 110:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"110\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"110\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,110,3)\">Ps 110:3</ref> <highlight>thy people will be</highlight> (all) <highlight>voluntariness in the day of thy host</highlight> (be ready to volunteer, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br<sup>MP 133</sup></lookup>); <bdbheb>גֶּשֶׁם נדבות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 68:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,10)\">Ps 68:10</ref> <highlight>generous</highlight> (copious) <highlight>rain</highlight>; <bdbheb>בנדבה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 54:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,54,8)\">Ps 54:8</ref> <highlight>voluntarily</highlight>, and adverb. accusative <bdbheb>נדבה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,24)\">Deut 23:24</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>.). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>freewill, voluntary, offering:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> including gifts used in erection and furnishing of tabernacle <ref ref=\"Exod 35:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,29)\">Exod 35:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,3)\">Exod 36:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); for first temple <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,14)\">2Chr 31:14</ref>, second <ref ref=\"Ezra 1:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,1,6)\">Ezra 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:28\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,28)\">Ezra 8:28</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> including <bdbheb>עולה</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>שׁלמים</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezek 46:42\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,42)\">Ezek 46:42</ref> probably also <ref ref=\"Amos 4:5\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,5)\">Amos 4:5</ref>, <bdbheb>נדבות פִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:108\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"108\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"108\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,108)\">Ps 119:108</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> usually a <bdbheb>זֶבַח</bdbheb> for festival meals at Passover <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,8)\">2Chr 35:8</ref>, Pentecost <ref ref=\"Deut 16:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,10)\">Deut 16:10</ref>, Tabernacles <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,5)\">Ezra 3:5</ref> (besides the ritual offerings); distinguished from <bdbheb>נֶדֶר</bdbheb> votive offering <ref ref=\"Lev 7:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,16)\">Lev 7:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 15:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,3)\">Num 15:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:39\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,39)\">Num 29:39</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Lev 22:18\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(3,22,18)\">Lev 22:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 22:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,22,21)\">Lev 22:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 22:23\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(3,22,23)\">Lev 22:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:38\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,38)\">Lev 23:38</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 12:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,6)\">Deut 12:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,17)\">Deut 12:17</ref>. — (Verbs used are <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הביא נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,29)\">Exod 35:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,3)\">Exod 36:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הקריב נ</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Lev 22:18\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(3,22,18)\">Lev 22:18</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עשׂה נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 15:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,3)\">Num 15:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,12)\">Ezek 46:12</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נתן נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 23:38\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,38)\">Lev 23:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 16:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,10)\">Deut 16:10</ref>.) </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 35:29", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 35, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Deut 16:10", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 16, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Amos 4:5", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ps 68:10", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 68, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ps 110:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 110, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 119:108", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 119, "verse": 108}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:14", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Deut 12:7", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 12, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Hos 14:5", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ps 54:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 54, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 23:24", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 23, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Exod 36:3", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 36, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezra 1:6", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 1, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezra 8:28", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 8, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ezek 46:42", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 46, "verse": 42}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:8", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ezra 3:5", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 3, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Lev 7:16", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 7, "verse": 16}